  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Flash Appeller 2010 f&#xf6;r Kirgizistan. Bidra med o&#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkt st&#xf6;d till UNHCR (10 MSEK). Det h&#xe4;r st&#xf6;det kommer att resultera i att bidra till b&#xe4;ttre m&#xe4;nsklig s&#xe4;kerhet, skydd och tillg&#xe5;ng till basala servisen f&#xf6;r m&#xe5;lgruppen (1 miljon m&#xe4;nniskor), inklusive utsatta folk.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Flash Appeals 2010 for Kyrgyzstan. Contributing  o&#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkt support for the UNHCR (10 million). This support will result in helping to improve human security, protection and access to basic dinnerware for the target audience (1 million people), including vulnerable people.</narrative>
  </description>
